# Build context = engineering/codebase/ (parent of forever-pin.backend-services + forever-pin.frontend-services).

# Build outputs — restored/rebuilt fresh inside the image
**/bin
**/obj
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/logs

# Locally-deployed SPA — the spa stage rebuilds it from source
**/wwwroot

# Local settings and secrets — never baked into an image layer
**/.env*
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.Target.json
**/appsettings.Machine.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db

# IDE / VCS / OS cruft
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/.vite
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store
